    "media:imagetext": "Emergency Information\nYour jet is under the command of an experienced Captain and crew.\nThey have been thoroughly trained in every emergency procedure.\nPlease follow their instructions should an emergency arise. For your\nadded safety and comfort we urge you to note the locations of the\nexits and safety equipment indicated on this chart.\nQUICK EXIT LOCATIONS\nBOEING 727/200\nFORE\nOCKP\nSLIDE\nFORWARD\nCABIN DOOR\nSLIDE\nFORWARD\nGALLEY DOOR\nWINDOW EXITS\nWINDOW EXITS\nSLIDE\nSLIDE\nAFT\nCABIN DOOR\nREAR CABIN\nDOOR\nCAN BE USED IF OPENED DURING\nEMERGENCIES\nAFT\nGALLEY DOOR\nTHE PRIMARY EXITS\nBESEISECONDARY EXITS\nSEE OTHER SIDE FOR ADDITIONAL INFORMATION\nBRANIFF InTERNATIOnAL\n963-525035 (REV. 11-77)",
